(20865, 1, '2024-10-22 15:31:42', '2024-10-22 15:31:42', '<img width=\"628\" height=\"105\" src=\"https://quantalhq.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/quantal1.png\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://quantalhq.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/quantal1.png 628w, https://quantalhq.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/quantal1-600x100.png 600w, https://quantalhq.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/quantal1-300x50.png 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 628px) 100vw, 628px\" />													\n		<p>Explore our comprehensive AI solutions dashboard designed to provide actionable business insights and drive innovation</p>		\n			<a href=\"https://demo.artureanec.com/themes/neuros/services-page/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n						</a>\n			<a href=\"https://demo.artureanec.com/themes/neuros/services-page/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n						</a>\n														<a href=\"#\">\n							<img width=\"98\" height=\"100\" src=\"https://quantalhq.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/Messenger-Logo-1-1.png\" alt=\"\" />								</a>\n														<a href=\"#\">\n							<img width=\"88\" height=\"90\" src=\"https://quantalhq.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/skype-logo-vector-icon-template-clipart-download-0-1-1.png\" alt=\"\" />								</a>\n														<a href=\"#\">\n							<img width=\"100\" height=\"102\" src=\"https://quantalhq.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/Telegram-Symbol-1-1.png\" alt=\"\" />								</a>\n														<a href=\"#\">\n							<img width=\"102\" height=\"104\" src=\"https://quantalhq.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/discord-1-1.png\" alt=\"\" />								</a>\n													<img width=\"266\" height=\"66\" src=\"https://quantalhq.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/OpenAI_Logo-1-1.png\" alt=\"\" />													\n			<a href=\"https://demo.artureanec.com/themes/neuros/services-page/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n						</a>\n			Happy clients			\n				0\n				K+\n													<img width=\"628\" height=\"105\" src=\"https://quantalhq.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/quantal2.png\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://quantalhq.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/quantal2.png 628w, https://quantalhq.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/quantal2-300x50.png 300w, https://quantalhq.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/quantal2-600x100.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 628px) 100vw, 628px\" />													\n													<img width=\"1243\" height=\"1136\" src=\"https://quantalhq.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/Image-min-1.png\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://quantalhq.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/Image-min-1.png 1243w, https://quantalhq.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/Image-min-1-600x548.png 600w, https://quantalhq.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/Image-min-1-300x274.png 300w, https://quantalhq.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/Image-min-1-1024x936.png 1024w, https://quantalhq.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/Image-min-1-768x702.png 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1243px) 100vw, 1243px\" />													\n		<p>AI</p><p><strong>Case Study 1: Enhancing Portfolio Management with AI</strong></p>\n<p>\"Learn how Quantal helped a leading asset management firm improve portfolio performance with AI-powered risk modeling.\"</p>\n<p><strong>Case Study 2: Automating Financial Reporting for a Global Bank </strong></p>\n<p>\"Discover how Quantal’s AI solutions reduced reporting times by 50%, enabling real-time financial insights.\"</p>		\n				0\n				%\n		<p>Achieved a 95% customer satisfaction rate across all AI solutions.</p>		\n				$\n				0\n				 mil\n		<p>Delivered over $10 million in cost savings for clients through optimized AI solutions.</p><p>Sentiment analysis and text mining<br />Language translation and text summarization</p>		\n													<img width=\"365\" height=\"296\" src=\"https://quantalhq.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/abstract-concept-colorful-men-his-brain-3d-rendering-1-min-1.png\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://quantalhq.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/abstract-concept-colorful-men-his-brain-3d-rendering-1-min-1.png 365w, https://quantalhq.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/abstract-concept-colorful-men-his-brain-3d-rendering-1-min-1-300x243.png 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 365px) 100vw, 365px\" />													\n		<p>Seamless integration with existing systems and platforms&amp; Scalable and flexible architecture</p>		\n													<img width=\"122\" height=\"29\" src=\"https://quantalhq.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/Devices-1.png\" alt=\"\" />													\n													<img width=\"266\" height=\"66\" src=\"https://quantalhq.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/OpenAI_Logo-1-1.png\" alt=\"\" />													\n													<img width=\"628\" height=\"105\" src=\"https://quantalhq.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/quantal1.png\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://quantalhq.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/quantal1.png 628w, https://quantalhq.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/quantal1-600x100.png 600w, https://quantalhq.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/quantal1-300x50.png 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 628px) 100vw, 628px\" />													\n                                                                                Know More\n                                                                                Know More\n			Awesome team members			\n				0\n				+\n													<img width=\"146\" height=\"25\" src=\"https://quantalhq.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/stars-intro-1.png\" alt=\"\" />													\n													<img width=\"146\" height=\"25\" src=\"https://quantalhq.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/stars-intro-1.png\" alt=\"\" />													\n		<p>\"Quantal has revolutionized how we approach data. Their AI solutions are the backbone of our decision-making process.\"</p>		\n													<img width=\"146\" height=\"25\" src=\"https://quantalhq.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/stars-intro-1.png\" alt=\"\" />													\n		<p>\"Quantal has revolutionized how we approach data. Their AI solutions are the backbone of our decision-making process.\"</p>		\n													<img width=\"146\" height=\"25\" src=\"https://quantalhq.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/stars-intro-1.png\" alt=\"\" />													\n		<p>\"Quantal has revolutionized how we approach data. Their AI solutions are the backbone of our decision-making process.\"</p>		\n													<img width=\"146\" height=\"25\" src=\"https://quantalhq.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/stars-intro-1.png\" alt=\"\" />													\n		<p>\"Quantal has revolutionized how we approach data. Their AI solutions are the backbone of our decision-making process.\"</p>		\n													<img width=\"146\" height=\"25\" src=\"https://quantalhq.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/stars-intro-1.png\" alt=\"\" />													\n		<p>Nice theme with excellent support from the developers. All of my doubts and requests were fixed within a day.</p>		\n													<img width=\"146\" height=\"25\" src=\"https://quantalhq.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/stars-intro-1.png\" alt=\"\" />													\n		<p>Amazing customer support. I had one modifications and the customer support was super helpful and quick to answer them both.</p>		\n													<img width=\"146\" height=\"25\" src=\"https://quantalhq.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/stars-intro-1.png\" alt=\"\" />													\n		<p>code quality very high and they have very detailed documentaion also they have very corporate for customer ticket</p>		\n													<img width=\"146\" height=\"25\" src=\"https://quantalhq.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/stars-intro-1.png\" alt=\"\" />													\n		<p>the customer suport is excellent！Thank you Sergey for your quick response and everything you did for me!</p>		\n													<img width=\"146\" height=\"25\" src=\"https://quantalhq.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/stars-intro-1.png\" alt=\"\" />													\n		<p>A perfect theme in every respect. They are very good especially in terms of support. I definitely recommend it. I bought dozens of themes. If I put them all on top of each other, it can\'t catch the success of this theme.</p>		\n													<img width=\"146\" height=\"25\" src=\"https://quantalhq.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/stars-intro-1.png\" alt=\"\" />													\n		<p>This is one of the best Theme I\'ve purchased thus far. And the customer support by the Author is first-class. Very professional and attentive to my needs. Thanks for sharing your work.</p>		\n													<img width=\"146\" height=\"25\" src=\"https://quantalhq.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/stars-intro-1.png\" alt=\"\" />													\n		<p>Wonderful and clean design will create an excellent base for starting the new agency. Especially when you don\'t want to do design turnkey and are looking for something to help you make a fast and easy launch.</p>		\n													<img width=\"146\" height=\"25\" src=\"https://quantalhq.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/stars-intro-1.png\" alt=\"\" />													\n		<p>Fast and good support.Theme easy to customize and many usable custom Elementor theme widgets.Nice work.</p>		\n													<img width=\"146\" height=\"25\" src=\"https://quantalhq.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/stars-intro-1.png\" alt=\"\" />													\n		<p>Great renewable energy theme for business.I recommend this Energium theme because it is very well-designed and easy to configure with elementor, and apply your own design.<br />Great job.</p>		\n													<img width=\"146\" height=\"25\" src=\"https://quantalhq.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/stars-intro-1.png\" alt=\"\" />													\n		<p>Nice theme with excellent support from the developers. All of my doubts and requests were fixed within a day.</p>		\n													<img width=\"146\" height=\"25\" src=\"https://quantalhq.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/stars-intro-1.png\" alt=\"\" />													\n		<p>Great theme, and great customer support!The author always provided a solution even though it was not theme related.<br />I\'ll surely buy new WordPress themes from Artureanec.</p>		\n													<img width=\"146\" height=\"25\" src=\"https://quantalhq.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/stars-intro-1.png\" alt=\"\" />													\n		<p>I purchased the theme because I really liked the design. After I started working with it I realized that I needed to translate some elements into Romanian.</p>		\n													<img width=\"146\" height=\"25\" src=\"https://quantalhq.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/stars-intro-1.png\" alt=\"\" />													\n		<p>the customer suport is excellent！Thank you Sergey for your quick response and everything you did for me!</p>		\n													<img width=\"146\" height=\"25\" src=\"https://quantalhq.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/stars-intro-1.png\" alt=\"\" />													\n		<p>A perfect theme in every respect. They are very good especially in terms of support. I definitely recommend it. I bought dozens of themes. If I put them all on top of each other, it can\'t catch the success of this theme.</p>		\n													<img width=\"146\" height=\"25\" src=\"https://quantalhq.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/stars-intro-1.png\" alt=\"\" />													\n		<p>This is one of the best Theme I\'ve purchased thus far. And the customer support by the Author is first-class. Very professional and attentive to my needs. Thanks for sharing your work.</p>		\n													<img width=\"146\" height=\"25\" src=\"https://quantalhq.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/stars-intro-1.png\" alt=\"\" />													\n		<p>Nice theme with excellent support from the developers. All of my doubts and requests were fixed within a day.</p>		\n													<img width=\"146\" height=\"25\" src=\"https://quantalhq.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/stars-intro-1.png\" alt=\"\" />													\n		<p>Great theme, and great customer support!The author always provided a solution even though it was not theme related.<br />I\'ll surely buy new WordPress themes from Artureanec.</p>		\n													<img width=\"146\" height=\"25\" src=\"https://quantalhq.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/stars-intro-1.png\" alt=\"\" />													\n		<p>I purchased the theme because I really liked the design. After I started working with it I realized that I needed to translate some elements into Romanian.</p><p>If you have any questions or concerns about this Privacy Policy or our privacy practices, please contact us</p><p>+1-848-306-0303</p><p>+1-848-306-0303</p><p>430 Park Avenue, New York, NY 10022</p><p>contact@quantalhq.com</p><p>contact@quantalhq.com</p>		\n					<a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/quantalhq/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n						Linkedin\n											</a>\n					<a href=\"https://x.com/quantalhq\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n						X-twitter\n											</a>\nDefine your goals and identify areas where AI can add value to your business\n \n													<img width=\"628\" height=\"105\" src=\"https://quantalhq.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/quantal1.png\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://quantalhq.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/quantal1.png 628w, https://quantalhq.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/quantal1-600x100.png 600w, https://quantalhq.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/quantal1-300x50.png 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 628px) 100vw, 628px\" />', 'Home 7', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '13472-revision-v1', '', '', '2024-10-22 15:31:42', '2024-10-22 15:31:42', '', 13472, 'https://quantalhq.com/?p=20865', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(20866, 1, '2024-10-22 15:31:49', '2024-10-22 15:31:49', '<p>For general questions about Quantal and our AI solutions, or if you’d like to learn more about how we can help your organization:</p><p>+1-848-306-0303</p><p>contact@quantalhq.com</p><p>430 Park Avenue, New York, NY 10022</p>		\n					<a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/quantalhq/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n						Linkedin-in\n											</a>\n					<a href=\"https://x.com/quantalhq\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n						X-twitter\n											</a>\n		<p>Looking to join a dynamic, growing team at the cutting edge of AI in finance? Visit our Careers page for open positions, or contact our HR team for more information</p><p>careers@quantalhq.com</p><p>Have a specific question or want to get in touch directly? Fill out the form below, and we’ll get back to you within 24 hours.</p>', 'Contacts', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '71-revision-v1', '', '', '2024-10-22 15:31:49', '2024-10-22 15:31:49', '', 71, 'https://quantalhq.com/?p=20866', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(20867, 1, '2024-10-22 15:31:49', '2024-10-22 15:31:49', '<p>For general questions about Quantal and our AI solutions, or if you’d like to learn more about how we can help your organization:</p><p>+1-848-306-0303</p><p>contact@quantalhq.com</p><p>430 Park Avenue, New York, NY 10022</p>		\n					<a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/quantalhq/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n						Linkedin-in\n											</a>\n					<a href=\"https://x.com/quantalhq\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n						X-twitter\n											</a>\n		<p>Looking to join a dynamic, growing team at the cutting edge of AI in finance? Visit our Careers page for open positions, or contact our HR team for more information</p><p>careers@quantalhq.com</p><p>Have a specific question or want to get in touch directly? Fill out the form below, and we’ll get back to you within 24 hours.</p>', 'Contacts', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '71-revision-v1', '', '', '2024-10-22 15:31:49', '2024-10-22 15:31:49', '', 71, 'https://quantalhq.com/?p=20867', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(20868, 1, '2024-10-22 15:31:50', '2024-10-22 15:31:50', '<p>For general questions about Quantal and our AI solutions, or if you’d like to learn more about how we can help your organization:</p><p>+1-848-306-0303</p><p>contact@quantalhq.com</p><p>430 Park Avenue, New York, NY 10022</p>		\n					<a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/quantalhq/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n						Linkedin-in\n											</a>\n					<a href=\"https://x.com/quantalhq\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n						X-twitter\n											</a>\n		<p>Looking to join a dynamic, growing team at the cutting edge of AI in finance? Visit our Careers page for open positions, or contact our HR team for more information</p><p>careers@quantalhq.com</p><p>Have a specific question or want to get in touch directly? Fill out the form below, and we’ll get back to you within 24 hours.</p>', 'Contacts', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '71-revision-v1', '', '', '2024-10-22 15:31:50', '2024-10-22 15:31:50', '', 71, 'https://quantalhq.com/?p=20868', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(20869, 1, '2024-10-22 15:35:51', '2024-10-22 15:35:51', '<img width=\"332\" height=\"114\" src=\"https://quantalhq.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/Quantal-1.png\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://quantalhq.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/Quantal-1.png 332w, https://quantalhq.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/Quantal-1-300x103.png 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 332px) 100vw, 332px\" />													\n		<p>At Quantal, we believe in the transformative power of AI to reshape the financial industry. Founded with a vision to bridge the gap between cutting-edge technology and practical business applications, Quantal specializes in delivering AI-driven solutions tailored for the complexities of finance. Our expertise lies in harnessing advanced data analytics, automation, and generative AI to help financial institutions make smarter, faster, and more reliable decisions. We are more than just a technology provider—we are your partners in innovation, dedicated to helping you navigate the evolving landscape of finance with confidence.</p>		\n													<img width=\"1024\" height=\"683\" src=\"https://quantalhq.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/mitchell-luo-I-unsplash-5-min-1-1024x683.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://quantalhq.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/mitchell-luo-I-unsplash-5-min-1-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://quantalhq.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/mitchell-luo-I-unsplash-5-min-1-600x400.jpg 600w, https://quantalhq.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/mitchell-luo-I-unsplash-5-min-1-300x200.jpg 300w, https://quantalhq.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/mitchell-luo-I-unsplash-5-min-1-768x512.jpg 768w, https://quantalhq.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/mitchell-luo-I-unsplash-5-min-1.jpg 1866w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" />													\n		<p>\"To empower the financial industry with AI-driven innovation, enabling smarter decisions, streamlined operations, and a future-ready approach to finance.\"</p><p>Our leadership team combines deep expertise in AI, data science, and financial services, guiding Quantal toward delivering high-impact solutions that solve real-world challenges. With years of experience working at the intersection of technology and finance, we are equipped to bring the best of both worlds to our clients.</p><p><strong>At Quantal, we are driven by a core set of values that guide our work and client relationships:</strong></p><ul><li>Innovation: Constantly pushing the boundaries of what’s possible with AI to deliver forward-thinking solutions.</li><li>Reliability: Trusted by the leading names in finance, we ensure our solutions are robust, scalable, and dependable.</li><li>Collaboration: Working closely with our clients to understand their unique challenges and deliver solutions that align with their business goals.</li><li>Integrity: We are committed to maintaining transparency, ethical practices, and a client-first approach in everything we do.</li></ul>		\n													<img width=\"911\" height=\"601\" src=\"https://quantalhq.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/human-brain-2-min-1.png\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://quantalhq.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/human-brain-2-min-1.png 911w, https://quantalhq.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/human-brain-2-min-1-600x396.png 600w, https://quantalhq.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/human-brain-2-min-1-300x198.png 300w, https://quantalhq.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/human-brain-2-min-1-768x507.png 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 911px) 100vw, 911px\" />													\n			Awesome team members			\n				0\n				+\n		<p>Pacific hake false trevally queen parrotfish black prickleback mosshead warbonnet sweeper! Greenling sleeper.</p><p>+1-848-306-0303</p><p>+1-848-306-0303</p><p>430 Park Avenue, New York, NY 10022</p><p>contact@quantalhq.com</p><p>contact@quantalhq.com</p>		\n					<a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/quantalhq/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n						Linkedin\n											</a>\n					<a href=\"https://x.com/quantalhq\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n						X-twitter\n											</a>\nDefine your goals and identify areas where AI can add value to your business\n ', 'Meet Quantal', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '2324-revision-v1', '', '', '2024-10-22 15:35:51', '2024-10-22 15:35:51', '', 2324, 'https://quantalhq.com/?p=20869', 0, 'revision', '', 0);
INSERT INTO `wp_posts` (`ID`, `post_author`, `post_date`, `post_date_gmt`, `post_content`, `post_title`, `post_excerpt`, `post_status`, `comment_status`, `ping_status`, `post_password`, `post_name`, `to_ping`, `pinged`, `post_modified`, `post_modified_gmt`, `post_content_filtered`, `post_parent`, `guid`, `menu_order`, `post_type`, `post_mime_type`, `comment_count`) VALUES
(20870, 1, '2024-10-22 15:35:51', '2024-10-22 15:35:51', '<img width=\"332\" height=\"114\" src=\"https://quantalhq.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/Quantal-1.png\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://quantalhq.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/Quantal-1.png 332w, https://quantalhq.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/Quantal-1-300x103.png 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 332px) 100vw, 332px\" />													\n		<p>At Quantal, we believe in the transformative power of AI to reshape the financial industry. Founded with a vision to bridge the gap between cutting-edge technology and practical business applications, Quantal specializes in delivering AI-driven solutions tailored for the complexities of finance. Our expertise lies in harnessing advanced data analytics, automation, and generative AI to help financial institutions make smarter, faster, and more reliable decisions. We are more than just a technology provider—we are your partners in innovation, dedicated to helping you navigate the evolving landscape of finance with confidence.</p>		\n													<img width=\"1024\" height=\"683\" src=\"https://quantalhq.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/mitchell-luo-I-unsplash-5-min-1-1024x683.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://quantalhq.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/mitchell-luo-I-unsplash-5-min-1-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://quantalhq.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/mitchell-luo-I-unsplash-5-min-1-600x400.jpg 600w, https://quantalhq.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/mitchell-luo-I-unsplash-5-min-1-300x200.jpg 300w, https://quantalhq.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/mitchell-luo-I-unsplash-5-min-1-768x512.jpg 768w, https://quantalhq.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/mitchell-luo-I-unsplash-5-min-1.jpg 1866w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" />													\n		<p>\"To empower the financial industry with AI-driven innovation, enabling smarter decisions, streamlined operations, and a future-ready approach to finance.\"</p><p>Our leadership team combines deep expertise in AI, data science, and financial services, guiding Quantal toward delivering high-impact solutions that solve real-world challenges. With years of experience working at the intersection of technology and finance, we are equipped to bring the best of both worlds to our clients.</p><p><strong>At Quantal, we are driven by a core set of values that guide our work and client relationships:</strong></p><ul><li>Innovation: Constantly pushing the boundaries of what’s possible with AI to deliver forward-thinking solutions.</li><li>Reliability: Trusted by the leading names in finance, we ensure our solutions are robust, scalable, and dependable.</li><li>Collaboration: Working closely with our clients to understand their unique challenges and deliver solutions that align with their business goals.</li><li>Integrity: We are committed to maintaining transparency, ethical practices, and a client-first approach in everything we do.</li></ul>		\n													<img width=\"911\" height=\"601\" src=\"https://quantalhq.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/human-brain-2-min-1.png\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://quantalhq.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/human-brain-2-min-1.png 911w, https://quantalhq.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/human-brain-2-min-1-600x396.png 600w, https://quantalhq.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/human-brain-2-min-1-300x198.png 300w, https://quantalhq.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/human-brain-2-min-1-768x507.png 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 911px) 100vw, 911px\" />													\n			Awesome team members			\n				0\n				+\n		<p>Pacific hake false trevally queen parrotfish black prickleback mosshead warbonnet sweeper! Greenling sleeper.</p><p>+1-848-306-0303</p><p>+1-848-306-0303</p><p>430 Park Avenue, New York, NY 10022</p><p>contact@quantalhq.com</p><p>contact@quantalhq.com</p>		\n					<a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/quantalhq/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n						Linkedin\n											</a>\n					<a href=\"https://x.com/quantalhq\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n						X-twitter\n											</a>\nDefine your goals and identify areas where AI can add value to your business\n ', 'Meet Quantal', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '2324-revision-v1', '', '', '2024-10-22 15:35:51', '2024-10-22 15:35:51', '', 2324, 'https://quantalhq.com/?p=20870', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
